u+v)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v+\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\n$$\n\nApplying the sum formula for sine with $u=x$ and $v=\\frac{7\\pi }{6},$ we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+\\frac{7\\pi }{6}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{6})+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{6}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot (\\frac{-\\sqrt{3}}{2})+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot (\\frac{-1}{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-142026/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4b12a7b7-1df3-5203-934e-8820604de3de"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-142026"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-274570/field-1/3b1e7f2cc6ae7e186407c31071eb119fa9c19a78ac0964aad6b41c3ad58ab823" :answer/id #uuid "1ae20ce2-694e-5bba-a05f-356eb4ac082c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\cos(x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-274570/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "5bdf9991-0d54-541f-ae70-4bc39e2e1123" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-274570/field-1/3b1e7f2cc6ae7e186407c31071eb119fa9c19a78ac0964aad6b41c3ad58ab823" :answer-field/choices ["q-274570/field-1/3b1e7f2cc6ae7e186407c31071eb119fa9c19a78ac0964aad6b41c3ad58ab823"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-274570" :question/id #uuid "8ccc5e48-13ba-566a-8551-38d534360fd4" :question/math-academy-id "q-274570" :question/problem "Express $\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-{270}^{∘})$ in terms of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ or $\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.$\n\n$\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-{270}^{∘})=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Recall the difference formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(u-v)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v-\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\n$$\n\nApplying the difference formula for sine with $u=x$ and $v={270}^{∘},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-{270}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡{270}^{∘}-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡{270}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot (0)-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-274570/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "69e91ce7-259a-5a11-bb79-7e6ad7ea86d4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-274570"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-329275/field-1/4bd87ad5cdff0b2d0aa7574d5c7450ac33fa34774f895ce16d251ca09a1932ec" :answer/id #uuid "475a81dd-5dfa-5c28-9688-ebaa11ae5f47" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-329275/field-1/e014eef6d5b5b99f76a63badf4d7e4589d1524a951e6f15c41809dcf478e3da9" :answer/id #uuid "c574eea4-7ac9-5c4a-ac18-cbea5fbd544e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-329275/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "f7883e5d-c264-57dc-a266-253b4365ac3a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-329275/field-1/4bd87ad5cdff0b2d0aa7574d5c7450ac33fa34774f895ce16d251ca09a1932ec" :answer-field/choices ["q-329275/field-1/4bd87ad5cdff0b2d0aa7574d5c7450ac33fa34774f895ce16d251ca09a1932ec" "q-329275/field-1/e014eef6d5b5b99f76a63badf4d7e4589d1524a951e6f15c41809dcf478e3da9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-329275/field-2/e014eef6d5b5b99f76a63badf4d7e4589d1524a951e6f15c41809dcf478e3da9" :answer/id #uuid "41fc3637-df15-51d9-88cb-d214400c781b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-329275/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "6a6e6939-91c9-58e1-8a95-0095d6ca9809" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/ty